invariant: INV-33
file: handshake_auth.c
catches: webpki_auth_test
reason: webpki_server_key accepts a chain that verifies without asking
  whether a pin names a key on its path, so a configuration with both a
  name and pins passes on the name alone, against RFC 8310 §6.4.
  bin/webpki_auth_test's chain rows that pin nothing the server sent
  object.

